---
source: crates/schema/src/describe.rs
expression: "describe_table(&prefix, owning, table, PrettyPrintStyle::NoColor)"
---
player (public)
  Columns:
    id         U64             primary key, auto-increment
    name       String
    rank       U32             unique
    nickname   Option<String>
    joined_at  Timestamp
    avatar     Thumbnail
    color      Color           default: (red = ())
    level      U32             default: 1
  Indexes:
    player_id_idx_btree     btree (id)
    player_name_idx_hash    hash (name)
    player_rank_idx_direct  direct (rank)
